{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "spanish", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1713916800, "end_date": 1714521599, "month_true_total": 2144, "quota": 25, "returned": 25, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:30:52 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "163949058", "author": {"steamid": "76561199235609050", "personaname": "Macaquihno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199235609050/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3065, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 624, "last_played": 1778709789, "avatar": "b1472829f3bf8cdcffa28aa9743de97e9b24ef83"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "esta chulo", "timestamp_created": 1714521281, "timestamp_updated": 1714521281, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163948494", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154600756", "personaname": "Luxell", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198154600756/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 9167, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9167, "last_played": 1772300235, "avatar": "91c1b1f3731e19edb367dca5c6601da5a1f71bc6"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "El juego esta genial, me encantaría jugarlo, de verdad.\nPero no puedo ni iniciar desde el ultimo parche.\nSe crashea en la cinemática del comienzo, a veces ni me abre el juego, si tengo suerte me deja seleccionar la misión que quiero jugar pero da igual, se crashea en la pantalla de carga.\nYa son 3 días que trato de arreglar el problema del crash por mi cuenta, probé de todo y de verdad digo DE TODO, No se arregla\nYa trate de todo para arreglar lo del crasheo, pero se nota que es algo relacionado con el ultimo parche.\nOjala lo arreglen pronto, para poder volver a jugar", "timestamp_created": 1714520583, "timestamp_updated": 1788062401, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163947588", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133841299", "personaname": "DaikiK (Trabuco)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198133841299/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 10401, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 450, "playtime_at_review": 4149, "last_played": 1787693657, "avatar": "5ecc9299a7d9ce43198b5db58cd7b153c55a4789"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "ta wapo", "timestamp_created": 1714519542, "timestamp_updated": 1714519542, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163946519", "author": {"steamid": "76561198189229061", "personaname": "sergirrodriguez", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198189229061/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 36706, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15099, "last_played": 1774908410, "avatar": "6a991cedbf9caf7e0dfd32c5f17f13820c818bf8"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "El juego empezó bien siendo divertido y entretenido, pero como era de esperar los bugs, errores y desconexiones en medio de las partidas hacen el juego frustrante y que sinceramente se te quitan las ganas de jugarlo porque no son ocasionales ni raros sino que son frecuentes de 5 partidas 3 no las terminas eso con suerte si entras en una. Los nerfeos tampoco ayudan si al menos el juego fuera estable en términos de jugabilidad entendería el balanceo de armas, pero viendo el estado del juego no se justifican sólo empeoran la experiencia de juego haciendolo menos divertido obviamente. Espero que se pongan las pilas y lo arreglen.\n\n6 de mayo 2024: Mayormente jugable y han corregido bastantes bugs sobre todo las desconexiones en medio de las partidas aunque no es infrecuente encontrarte algún que otro fallo. Se recomienda jugarlo.", "timestamp_created": 1714518561, "timestamp_updated": 1714991271, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163945952", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047099319", "personaname": "Pantsu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047099319/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2724, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2569, "last_played": 1715874494, "avatar": "44f7dcd382c10c2995c161b7697709fdf21e32a2"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Compren el juego y luchen por la libertad y democracia", "timestamp_created": 1714518082, "timestamp_updated": 1714518082, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163945899", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039035451", "personaname": "Sakryszard Frost Y ❄", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://